 ll climbing levels\n\nHow to join: Book on The Boulder Garden's Capitan sc
 hedule\n\nBefore you go: Dec 10 is posted. Jan 14 and Feb 11 are expected 
 but not posted yet. The gym also runs an Intro to Bouldering Clinic (e.g.\
 , Mon Nov 16\, 7:30-9pm\, $20 non-members).\n\nhttps://climber.hellocapita
 n.com/thebouldergarden/schedule/event-type-details/2722/\n\nListed on Same
  Time Next Week.
