SUMMARY:Board game night · Atomic Empire
LOCATION:Atomic Empire\, 3400 Westgate Dr #14B\, Durham\, NC 27707
DESCRIPTION:Weekly open board gaming at Durham's big game store. Also: Frid
 ay Night Magic (incl. Commander Mixer)\, D&D Adventurers League Thursdays\
 , and a Wednesday Commander Nights league (Nov 11-Jan 27).\n\nBring a game
  or borrow from the demo shelf\n\nHow to join: Just show up\; check the st
 ore Discord #weekly-events-digest\n\nBefore you go: Space can be limited b
 y other events\; ~4 mi SW of downtown.\n\nhttps://www.atomicempire.com/Sto
 re/Event/2664\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.atomicempire.com/Store/Event/2664
