SUMMARY:Chess club · Durham Main Library
LOCATION:Durham County Main Library\, Meeting Room #4347\, 300 N Roxboro St
 \, Durham\, NC 27701
DESCRIPTION:Library chess club on selected Saturdays\, all ages and skill l
 evels.\n\nInstruction for beginners\; boards provided\n\nHow to join: Just
  show up\; questions wynnedavis@dconc.gov\n\nBefore you go: Jan-Feb dates 
 aren't posted yet. It tends to meet on the 1st and 3rd Saturdays.\n\nhttps
 ://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17022971\n\nListed on Same Time Ne
 xt Week.
