 01 classes start early Jan 2027 (registration ~early Dec)\n\nBefore you go
 : Only Nov 19 is posted right now. Later dates show up on Mettlesome's cal
 endar as they're announced.\n\nhttps://thisismettlesome.com\n\nListed on S
 ame Time Next Week.
