 urse Rd\, Chapel Hill\, NC 27517
DESCRIPTION:Free guided bird walks (formerly New Hope Audubon)\; no reserva
 tions\, all skill levels\, about twice a week in season.\n\nThese walks me
 et at Mason Farm Biological Preserve. The Bird Alliance posts each walk's 
 location a day or two ahead.\n\nHow to join: Just show up\; locations post
 ed on newhopebirdalliance.org 1-2 days ahead\n\nBefore you go: December to
  February walks aren't posted yet (it's Christmas Bird Count season).\n\nh
 ttps://newhopebirdalliance.org/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
