SUMMARY:First Friday art walk · Downtown Raleigh
LOCATION:Artspace and downtown galleries\, 201 E Davie St\, Raleigh\, NC 27
 601
DESCRIPTION:Free self-guided monthly walk through galleries\, studios and a
 lternative art spaces downtown\, with openings\, music and food.\n\nDozens
  of downtown galleries and studios take part\, each with its own hours. Ar
 tspace is open 4–10pm\, with a sensory-friendly hour from 4–6pm.\n\nHo
 w to join: Just show up\; the venue list is on the Downtown Raleigh Allian
 ce First Friday page\n\nBefore you go: The January 2027 First Friday falls
  on New Year's Day. Confirm whether it runs.\n\nhttps://triangleonthecheap
 .com/first-friday-raleigh\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://triangleonthecheap.com/first-friday-raleigh
