DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T063000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T083000
SUMMARY:Breakfast Club long run · Jubala Coffee
LOCATION:Jubala Coffee\, 301 Hillsborough St\, Ste 120\, Raleigh\, NC
DESCRIPTION:Very active downtown running group (900+ members\, rated 5.0) w
 hose Saturday long run ends with a group breakfast.\n\n6-10+ miles with pa
 ce groups from sub-7 to 10+ min/mile\, then coffee or breakfast. The club 
 also runs Tuesdays at 6am from Yellow Dog Bread Co. (219 E Franklin St).\n
 \nHow to join: RSVP on Meetup and show up\n\nBefore you go: Early start\; 
 check Meetup for holiday weekends.\n\nhttps://meetup.com/the-breakfast-clu
 b-runners\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://meetup.com/the-breakfast-club-runners
