SUMMARY:Science Cafe · NC Museum of Natural Sciences
LOCATION:NC Museum of Natural Sciences - Daily Planet Cafe\, 11 W Jones St\
 , Raleigh\, NC 27601
DESCRIPTION:Monthly casual science talk and conversation with host Chris Sm
 ith and a guest expert\, held in the museum cafe after hours. The Nov 19 t
 opic is Sri Lanka's elephants.\n\nThe Daily Planet Cafe serves food 5-8pm\
 n\nHow to join: Just show up\n\nBefore you go: Topics for December through
  February aren't posted. Confirm the Dec 17 session runs.\n\nhttps://natur
 alsciences.org/calendar/events/category/audience/adults/\n\nListed on Same
  Time Next Week.
