 ch week. A standing weekly run is an easy way to become a familiar face.\n
 \nEvery Sunday at 8:00am on a different local trail.\n\nHow to join: Find 
 the week's trail on Bull City Running's Facebook\, Instagram\, X/Twitter o
 r Strava club.\n\nBefore you go: Check BCR's Instagram\, Facebook or Strav
 a\, or ask in the store\, for each week's trail. Cost isn't stated.\n\nhtt
 ps://bullcityrunning.com/events/runclub/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
