SUMMARY:D&D Adventurers League · Atomic Empire
LOCATION:Atomic Empire\, 3400 Westgate Dr\, Durham\, NC 27707
DESCRIPTION:Organized-play D&D tables run by a DM. You reserve a seat and p
 lay with whoever else signs up\, so the table is a ready-made social group
 \, and no experience is needed.\n\n6:30–10:30pm. Bring dice (sold in the
  store)\, a pencil and paper\, and a miniature or marker.\n\nHow to join: 
 Reserve a seat on the store's Warhorn portal (look for DDEX games)\, check
 ing for open seats there before registering and paying on atomicempire.com
 . Bring dice (sold in store)\, a pencil and paper\, and a miniature or mar
 ker. A pre-made character sheet is optional.\n\nBefore you go: Jan-Feb 202
 7 dates aren't posted yet. Check whether the Nov 26 (Thanksgiving) game ru
 ns\; Dec 24 and Dec 31 aren't listed.\n\nhttps://www.atomicempire.com/Stor
 e/Event/313\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.atomicempire.com/Store/Event/313
