DTSTAMP:20261116T054425Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T120000
SUMMARY:Pop-up bike repair clinic · Durham Farmers' Market
LOCATION:Durham Farmers' Market\, Durham Central Park\, 501 Foster St\, Dur
 ham\, NC 27701
DESCRIPTION:A volunteer shift helping run a pop-up bike repair clinic at th
 e farmers' market. Working as a team in public is a natural way to meet pe
 ople.\n\nSat Nov 21\, 9am-12pm\, limited spots. A second clinic the same d
 ay at Crank Arm Durham (12-4pm) is full.\n\nHow to join: Sign up on durham
 bikecoop.corsizio.com\; spots are limited.\n\nBefore you go: The sign-up p
 age doesn't give a meeting spot\, so confirm where to find the co-op's ten
 t. It also doesn't say whether beginners can sign up.\n\nhttps://durhambik
 ecoop.corsizio.com/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://durhambikecoop.corsizio.com/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d-climbing-meetup-20261120@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261116T054425Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T203000
SUMMARY:Climbing meetup · Triangle Rock Club Durham
LOCATION:Triangle Rock Club - Durham\, 1010 Martin Luther King Jr Pkwy\, Su
 ite 400\, Durham\, NC
DESCRIPTION:An all-levels climbing group\, running since 2006\, that meets 
 in the gym's roped area\, with optional dinner afterward. Roped climbing p
 airs you with a partner\, which makes meeting people easy.\n\nFri Nov 20 a
 t 6:30pm. The group climbs on Fridays and rotates among TRC gyms: Nov 13 S
 alvage Yard (Raleigh)\, Nov 20 Durham\, Nov 27 North Raleigh\, Dec 4 Morri
 sville. Later Durham dates aren't visible yet.\n\nHow to join: RSVP on Mee
 tup. Check in at the TRC front desk\, then go to the roped area at the bac
 k of the gym. Dinner afterward is optional (venue TBD).\n\nBefore you go: 
 Only some of the group's events are posted\, so check Meetup for later Dur
 ham Fridays. The four-gym rotation suggests roughly every fourth Friday\, 
 but that isn't confirmed.\n\nhttps://www.meetup.com/raleighrockclimbing/\n
 \nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.meetup.com/raleighrockclimbing/
