SUMMARY:Fiction book club · South Regional Library
LOCATION:Durham County Library – South Regional Library (Adult Programmin
 g Room)\, 4505 S. Alston Ave\, Durham\, NC 27713
DESCRIPTION:Adults meet on the third Tuesday of every month to talk about a
  work of fiction. It's at South Regional Library in south Durham\, about 1
 5 minutes from downtown\, and everyone has read the same book\, so there's
  always something to talk about.\n\nHow to join: Come to the Adult Program
 ming Room at 6:30pm. Check the library's event page for this month's book.
 \n\nBefore you go: Check the event page for this month's book and whether 
 you need to register.\n\nhttps://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/1596
 1444\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
