 om)\, 221 Milton Rd\, Durham\, NC 27712
DESCRIPTION:A Monday-morning group\, mostly for socializing\, open to knitt
 ers\, crocheters and anyone doing other handwork. It's at North Regional L
 ibrary in north Durham. Bring a project and chat while you work. Beginners
  can get tips from experienced crafters.\n\nHow to join: Drop in with what
 ever project you're working on.\n\nBefore you go: On holiday weeks\, check
  the library calendar to confirm it's meeting.\n\nhttps://durhamcountylibr
 ary.libcal.com/event/15792181\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
