SUMMARY:Library Taskmaster (21+) · Durham Main Library
LOCATION:Durham County Library – Main Library (Main Auditorium)\, 300 N. 
 Roxboro St\, Durham\, NC 27701
DESCRIPTION:An adults-only library version of the comedy show Taskmaster. N
 umbers are drawn to pick contestants for five silly\, low-stakes games of 
 wit and creativity\, and the game winners meet in a live final. Because pl
 ayers are drawn at random\, people who've never met end up playing togethe
 r.\n\nHow to join: Register on the library's event page\, then arrive earl
 y. Seats are first come\, first served.\n\nBefore you go: Ages 21+. Regist
 ration is required but doesn't hold a seat\, so arrive early.\n\nhttps://d
 urhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17285805\n\nListed on Same Time Next W
 eek.
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17285805
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="300 N. Roxboro St, Durham,
  NC 27701";X-APPLE-RADIUS=70;X-TITLE="Durham County Library – Main Libra
 ry (Main Auditorium)":geo:35.994988,-78.89725
END:VEVENT
