SUMMARY:Open mic · The Bike Library
LOCATION:The Bike Library\, 600 W Cabarrus St #113\, Raleigh\, NC 27603
DESCRIPTION:A third-Friday open mic at a downtown bike shop and cafe\, open
  to musicians\, poets\, storytellers and people who just want to listen. T
 alking with performers between sets is an easy way to meet people.\n\nHow 
 to join: Show up on the third Friday. If you want to perform\, arrive earl
 y and ask about a slot.\n\nBefore you go: Some older listings show 6–8:3
 0 PM. The venue's own calendar shows 7–9 PM.\n\nhttps://thebikelibrary.c
 om/events\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
