DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261110T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261110T083000
SUMMARY:Espresso Express morning ride · The Bike Library
LOCATION:DuPont Circle\, Platform Raleigh Apartments (The Bike Library)\, 6
 00 W Cabarrus St\, Raleigh\, NC 27603
DESCRIPTION:A casual\, no-drop ride of 5–8 miles with a coffee stop\, hos
 ted by The Bike Library and billed as good for beginners. The coffee stop 
 gives the group time to talk.\n\nHow to join: Bring a bike and a helmet an
 d meet at DuPont Circle at Platform Raleigh Apartments by 7:00 AM.\n\nBefo
 re you go: The ride starts and ends at DuPont Circle in the Platform Ralei
 gh apartments\, where The Bike Library is. Check the events page if the we
 ather looks doubtful.\n\nhttps://thebikelibrary.com/events\n\nListed on Sa
 me Time Next Week.
URL:https://thebikelibrary.com/events
END:VEVENT
