SUMMARY:Friday game night · Quest (Garner)
LOCATION:Quest Fellowship Church\, 5120 Raynor Rd\, Garner\, NC 27529
DESCRIPTION:A big board game night\, usually 50 to 80 people\, with a libra
 ry of 200+ games and volunteers who teach them. Ages 16+\, or younger with
  a parent.\n\nDrop in any time after 6pm\; it runs until about midnight. I
 t meets about twice a month on Fridays\, and the next date after Nov 20 is
 n't posted yet.\n\nHow to join: Just show up (RSVP on Meetup if you like)\
 n\nhttps://www.meetup.com/game-nights-at-quest/\n\nListed on Same Time Nex
 t Week.
