SUMMARY:Food Bank sort\, Friday afternoon · Raleigh branch
LOCATION:Food Bank of Central & Eastern NC - Raleigh Branch\, 1924 Capital 
 Blvd\, Raleigh\, NC 27604 (volunteer entrance currently at 2439 Crabtree B
 lvd)
DESCRIPTION:Sort and repack donated food into family-size bags and boxes wi
 th a big crew of other volunteers at the Food Bank's Raleigh warehouse.\n\
 nOnly these two Friday afternoons have open spots right now\; Friday morni
 ngs are waitlisted. The Food Bank is closed Nov 27 and Dec 25.\n\nHow to j
 oin: Register online and pick the Friday 1–3:30pm Warehouse Project slot
  on the volunteer calendar on the Raleigh location page. Spots are limited
 \, so book early.\n\nhttps://foodbankcenc.org/locations/raleigh/\n\nListed
  on Same Time Next Week.
